  "description": "The clips of the Deeply Nonverbal Vocalization Dataset as its annotation file lists them: one record per recording, named by its sound class and file name, with the speaker, age, sex and noise level. Sex and noise level are the source's codes (sex 0 is female and 1 male, noise 0 is noiseless and 1 noisy). It carries none of the audio, which the download list of openslr-slr99 gives.",
